{
    "title": "Chess Online & Offline",
    "description": "Checkmate is a modern chess mobile app with friendly design, classical music in the background and the excitement of discovering the nuances of this wonderful board game. We created a new version of this royal game, innovative and full of surprises. The app offers the possibility to play online with players from all over the world (for rating points) and offline practice play with a computer (without rating points). This app was born from a fascination with chess - the game that has been moving minds and hearts of millions of players around the world for centuries!\r\n\r\nSome say that chess was born in India, others that in Persia. In many languages it is called differently: Chess, Scacchi, \u0936\u0924\u0930\u0902\u091c, \u00c9checs, Xadrez, Szachy, Schach, Ajedrez, \u0428\u0430\u0445\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044b, Satran\u00e7, \u30c1\u30a7\u30b9, \u68cb, \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0637\u0631\u0646\u062c. We have been playing this game for over 1500 years, and today it is played in almost 200 countries around the world - with new secrets still being discovered. People all over the world play millions of wars on a 64-field boards every day - you could say these are the real games of thrones. Chess conquered the world long ago and its popularity is growing constantly. We want to play our part in it!\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\u2022 Playing chess online with players from all over the world\r\n\u2022 Playing chess offline against the computer - you can choose the difficulty level from beginner to expert\r\n\u2022 Playing chess with your friends - you can invite your friends to play and accept invitations from others\r\n\u2022 Sound effects during the game to enhance the experience\r\n\u2022 Advanced haptics - various vibrations effects make the game even more engaging\r\n\u2022 Choice of 21 chessboard styles and 16 sets of chess pieces\r\n\u2022 Helpful markers showing: legal moves, last move, possible captures, king in check and more\r\n\u2022 Ability to use the pending move (also called premove) to avoid wasting time in games - when the opponent's move comes, your move will be made automatically\r\n\u2022 Ability to browse game history during the game\r\n\u2022 Over 3000 game openings with variations - the app recognizes them and displays information, e.g. Sicilian Defense, Queen's Gambit, Caro-Kann Defense, Italian Game and French Defense\r\n\u2022 Most beautiful pieces of classical music while using the app\r\n\r\n\r\nComing soon\r\n\u2022 Puzzles - solving chess puzzles helps develop your skills. It takes little time and you get points for guessing the best moves! 500,000+ tactics puzzles to solve - mate in 1, mate in 2, mate in 3, perpetual check, endgames, pin, fork, skewer, sacrifice, etc. - if you solve them quickly you will get a speed bonus!\r\n\u2022 Rankings - our global ranking and country rankings of all registered players! The order in the player rankings is determined by ELO rating, number of online games won, and points earned while solving puzzles. At any time you can check your exact position in the ranking in your country and worldwide!\r\n\r\n\r\nMore Details\r\n\u2022 Time-limited online games in the following modes: Classic (10, 20 and 30 minutes), Blitz (3, 5 and 3 minutes + 2s/move), Bullet (1 minute, 1 minute + 1s/move and 2 minutes + 1s/move)\r\n\u2022 In the online game you will meet players of all levels, from beginner to grandmaster\r\n\u2022 Strong computer for offline play with 16 strength levels (from 600 to 2100 ELO rating)\r\n\u2022 Rankings, players and computer strength in game are calculated using the Arpad Elo formula - well known as the ELO chess rating\r\n\u2022 Access to game statistics, editing user data including profile picture\r\n\u2022 Ultra-fast, efficient and reliable Firebase Firestore database which is part of the Google infrastructure - all to ensure the convenience and comfort of games for thousands of players simultaneously\r\n\u2022 Light and dark theme support\r\n\u2022 Material Design 3 interface\r\n\u2022 Checkmate Chess is free to download and use\r\n\u2022 Respecting your privacy and the security of your data\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\n\u2022 Visit SplendApps.com: https://splendapps.com/\r\n\u2022 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SplendApps/\r\n\u2022 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/splendapps/\r\n\u2022 Twitter: https://twitter.com/SplendApps",
    "descriptionHTML": "Checkmate is a modern chess mobile app with friendly design, classical music in the background and the excitement of discovering the nuances of this wonderful board game. We created a new version of this royal game, innovative and full of surprises. The app offers the possibility to play online with players from all over the world (for rating points) and offline practice play with a computer (without rating points). This app was born from a fascination with chess - the game that has been moving minds and hearts of millions of players around the world for centuries!<br><br>Some say that chess was born in India, others that in Persia. In many languages it is called differently: Chess, Scacchi, \u0936\u0924\u0930\u0902\u091c, \u00c9checs, Xadrez, Szachy, Schach, Ajedrez, \u0428\u0430\u0445\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044b, Satran\u00e7, \u30c1\u30a7\u30b9, \u68cb, \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0637\u0631\u0646\u062c. We have been playing this game for over 1500 years, and today it is played in almost 200 countries around the world - with new secrets still being discovered. People all over the world play millions of wars on a 64-field boards every day - you could say these are the real games of thrones. Chess conquered the world long ago and its popularity is growing constantly. We want to play our part in it!<br><br><br>Key Features<br>\u2022 Playing chess online with players from all over the world<br>\u2022 Playing chess offline against the computer - you can choose the difficulty level from beginner to expert<br>\u2022 Playing chess with your friends - you can invite your friends to play and accept invitations from others<br>\u2022 Sound effects during the game to enhance the experience<br>\u2022 Advanced haptics - various vibrations effects make the game even more engaging<br>\u2022 Choice of 21 chessboard styles and 16 sets of chess pieces<br>\u2022 Helpful markers showing: legal moves, last move, possible captures, king in check and more<br>\u2022 Ability to use the pending move (also called premove) to avoid wasting time in games - when the opponent&#39;s move comes, your move will be made automatically<br>\u2022 Ability to browse game history during the game<br>\u2022 Over 3000 game openings with variations - the app recognizes them and displays information, e.g. Sicilian Defense, Queen&#39;s Gambit, Caro-Kann Defense, Italian Game and French Defense<br>\u2022 Most beautiful pieces of classical music while using the app<br><br><br>Coming soon<br>\u2022 Puzzles - solving chess puzzles helps develop your skills. It takes little time and you get points for guessing the best moves! 500,000+ tactics puzzles to solve - mate in 1, mate in 2, mate in 3, perpetual check, endgames, pin, fork, skewer, sacrifice, etc. - if you solve them quickly you will get a speed bonus!<br>\u2022 Rankings - our global ranking and country rankings of all registered players! The order in the player rankings is determined by ELO rating, number of online games won, and points earned while solving puzzles. At any time you can check your exact position in the ranking in your country and worldwide!<br><br><br>More Details<br>\u2022 Time-limited online games in the following modes: Classic (10, 20 and 30 minutes), Blitz (3, 5 and 3 minutes + 2s/move), Bullet (1 minute, 1 minute + 1s/move and 2 minutes + 1s/move)<br>\u2022 In the online game you will meet players of all levels, from beginner to grandmaster<br>\u2022 Strong computer for offline play with 16 strength levels (from 600 to 2100 ELO rating)<br>\u2022 Rankings, players and computer strength in game are calculated using the Arpad Elo formula - well known as the ELO chess rating<br>\u2022 Access to game statistics, editing user data including profile picture<br>\u2022 Ultra-fast, efficient and reliable Firebase Firestore database which is part of the Google infrastructure - all to ensure the convenience and comfort of games for thousands of players simultaneously<br>\u2022 Light and dark theme support<br>\u2022 Material Design 3 interface<br>\u2022 Checkmate Chess is free to download and use<br>\u2022 Respecting your privacy and the security of your data<br><br><br>About Us<br>\u2022 Visit SplendApps.com: https://splendapps.com/<br>\u2022 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SplendApps/<br>\u2022 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/splendapps/<br>\u2022 Twitter: https://twitter.com/SplendApps",
